    "system": {
        "id": "sidestep",
        "type": "path",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Activation: </strong><span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Special Activation\" aria-label=\"Special Activation\">*</span></p><p><em>Sliding like a shadow, you flit past your foes’ strikes and evade blows that seem certain to connect.</em></p><p>Gain an additional <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Special Activation\" aria-label=\"Special Activation\">r</span> at the start of combat and at the start of each of your turns, which you can use only to @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.actions.Item.6Vm9QIbIjDOeSCwq]{Dodge}. You can’t benefit from this talent while wearing armor with a deflect value of 2 or higher.</p>",
            "chat": "<p><strong>Activation: </strong><span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Special Activation\" aria-label=\"Special Activation\">*</span></p><p>Gain an additional <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Special Activation\" aria-label=\"Special Activation\">r</span> to @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.actions.Item.6Vm9QIbIjDOeSCwq]{Dodge} when you’re not wearing armor with deflect of 2 or higher.</p>",
            "short": "<p><strong>Activation: </strong><span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Special Activation\" aria-label=\"Special Activation\">*</span></p><p>Gain an additional <span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Special Activation\" aria-label=\"Special Activation\">r</span> at the start of combat and at the start of each of your turns, which you can use only to @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg.actions.Item.6Vm9QIbIjDOeSCwq]{Dodge}. You can’t benefit from this talent while wearing armor with a deflect value of 2 or higher.</p>"
        },
